# Preliminary Conclusion

The previously planned RunReader/run-index integration has been completed.

Current implementation provides:

- Index-backed run discovery.
- Automatic index rebuilding.
- Verifier verdict enrichment.
- Filtering of incomplete runs.
- Typed `RunSummary` objects.
- Explicit handling of optional artifacts.
- Detection of partially written bundles.


